{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-f5054e5d006734063020","statement":"\\aligned &E_{11}v_i=(b+i'')v_i,\n\n&E_{22}v_i=(b-i'')v_i,\n\n&E_{12}v_i=(c+i'')v_{i+1},\n\n&E_{21}v_i=(c-i'')v_{i-1},\\endaligned","source_id":"arXiv:1612.08652","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"aa031a281a7985fdd8e9a88f50c96c4d6e81d13e7e34ba79a6fba325f1490b6e","kind":"equation","label":"Equation V","ref_key":"V","name":"","order":2,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.08652","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"1344535088c1db3b66a4339987c2e4bdd39355bbdff19bee66811cd44a96bed8","line":272,"origin":"latex_env:equation","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:14:41+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":122,"math_hints":12}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1612.08652","title":"New families of irreducible weight modules over $\\sl_{3}$","abstract":"Let $n>1$ be an integer, $α\\in{\\mathbb C}^n$, $b\\in{\\mathbb C}$, and $V$ a $\\mathfrak{gl}_n$-module. We define a class of weight modules $F^α_{b}(V)$ over $\\sl_{n+1}$ using the restriction of modules of tensor fields over the Lie algebra of vector fields on $n$-dimensional torus. In this paper we consider the case $n=2$ and prove the irreducibility of such 5-parameter $\\mathfrak{sl}_{3}$-modules $F^α_{b}(V)$ generically. All such modules have infinite dimensional weight spaces and lie outside of the category of Gelfand-Tsetlin modules. Hence, this construction yields new families of irreducible $\\mathfrak{sl}_{3}$-modules.","authors":["Vyacheslav Futorny","Genqiang Liu","Rencai Lu","Kaiming Zhao"],"year":"2016","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.08652","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"span":"\\text{span}","ZZ":"{\\mathbb Z}","C":"\\ensuremath{\\mathbb C}\\xspace","Q":"\\ensuremath{\\mathbb{Q}}\\xspace","a":"\\ensuremath{\\alpha}","h":"\\ensu